			"notes": "v2.2.0 — unified update across all loader/MC combinations.\n\nChanges\n- Remove FilterListScreen (redundant subset of main Config screen; reached via an undocumented Shift+C with different save semantics that made it actively confusing).\n- Buttons on the Merchant screen now render unconditionally (the old canCycle early-return gate was the reason they sometimes didn't appear).\n- Save button actually persists filters now (the save-then-revert-on-close bug was a pre-existing regression).\n- Fabric: R (Toggle Auto Trade Cycling) now fires while the Merchant screen is focused — hooked via ScreenKeyboardEvents.beforeKeyPress since KeyMapping.consumeClick() doesn't fire in a screen.\n- Lang: drop '(Hold Shift for Advanced Filters)' from Open Config keybind description now that the shortcut no longer exists; remove unused config.advanced_filters string.\n- Jar naming now follows easyautocycler-<loader>-<mcversion>-<modversion>.jar.\n- NeoForge 26.1.2 + Fabric 26.1.2 branches: full 26.1.2 port against MC's new deferred render-state pipeline.\n\nAll six branches carry the same mod_version 2.2.0."
		}
